@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

title Component and Connector View - Current Implementation

actor "Web User" as User
component "Frontend Web\n(React + Vite)" as Frontend
component "API Gateway\n(Nginx)" as Gateway

component "Auth Service\n(FastAPI)" as Auth
component "User Service\n(FastAPI)" as UserService
component "Product Service\n(FastAPI)" as Product

database "Auth PostgreSQL\n(auth-postgres)" as AuthDB
database "User PostgreSQL\n(user-postgres)" as UserDB
database "Redis\n(Session + Cache)" as Redis
queue "RabbitMQ\n(Event Bus)" as MQ

User --> Frontend : Browser HTTP
Frontend --> Gateway : REST JSON / HTTPS

Gateway --> Auth : /auth/*
Gateway --> UserService : /users/*, /internal/*
Gateway --> Product : /products/*

Auth --> AuthDB : users
Auth --> Redis : token sessions + blacklist
Auth --> MQ : AUTH_USER_REGISTERED

UserService --> UserDB : profiles + addresses
MQ --> UserService : profile creation events

Product --> UserDB : products + categories + reviews
Product --> Redis : auth validation + cache
Product --> UserService : seller profile lookup (HTTP)

note bottom of Product
Layered architecture in each service:
- Presentation: routers
- Application: services
- Domain: models/schemas
- Infrastructure: core/events
end note

@enduml
